:: OC Patrick Ivy Park Change [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 20>>

/* Intro */
You are strolling through the park just off the main path when a curious butterfly catches your attention. It flies directly in front of you, briefly startling you, but then the wonderous colors on its wings catch your interest. It is simply beautiful, and you watch the colorful insect fly about before it begins to flap away. Your interest caught, you follow it further into the park behind some bushes and trees when, <span style="color:Yellow">suddenly, a shocking sight causes you to freeze and forget all about the butterfly.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 2,
        },
    },
     {
        Name: "OC Ivy",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Happy",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Patrick",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Tired",
            PantsDown: true,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

Just behind some bushes you spy <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>, the strange rich boy who you encountered in an awkward and compromising position in the infirmary, lying on his back. <span style="color:Pink">His shirt has been lifted up and his bottoms tugged down to his ankles, once again revealing his big, poofy diaper. The boy turns his head and notices you, seemingly in the middle of being changed as he sips what appears to be chocolate milk from a bottle. The entire sight is just too much and you quickly spin around and cover your eyes, blushing.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey there <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>!”</span> You hear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> laugh, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We really do have to stop meeting like this, haha.”</span> You apologize and begin to walk away when you hear the boy laugh. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sorry? Didn’t I tell you? I don’t care if people see me like this. It’s not like I have anything between my legs that you don’t.”</span> He chuckles, <span style="color:Pink">sticking his tongue out at you before continuing to drink from his bottle.</span> <br>
<br>

/* No Diaper Kink */
<<if $Player.Kinks.Diapers != 1>>
    Regardless of what he says, you still feel weird seeing him like this and tell him thus. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Suit yourself, but I don’t see what you have to be embarrassed about. You’re not even the one being changed! Unless – you want to be?”</span> He laughs once more, wiggling his feet at you as you walk away uncomfortably. You stop a few feet away, trying to calm your nerves as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> is finished being changed and walks up behind you, now fully dressed but still holding his bottle. <br>
    
