    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“There we go. All clean!”</span> He says, patting the soft front of his crotch. You then notice the girl standing next to him. You were so embarrassed about the sight, you didn’t even register the person who was doing the changing. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, this is my sis, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span>. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span>, this is that one boy I was telling you about. You know, the one who-”</span>  He pauses and they both laugh, causing you to blush once more. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Nice to meet you, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span> gives you a wave and a playful smile, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I wish we could play with you, but we really gotta go. We got a photoshoot to do today and if we’re late Daddy will get upset.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">She giggles cutely, talking in the same babyish tone as her brother.</span> <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Awwww, but I wanted to play some more!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> sighs, slumping his shoulders down. While he keeps up appearances somewhat at school, out here he is really acting like a big toddler. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh well, I guess you’ll right. I don’t want to get in trouble. But maybe next time we can show you what we do for fun!”</span> He says happily to you, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We’ll see you later!”</span> He waves as the two of them run off. <span style="color:Yellow">You are left utterly bewildered by what you just witnessed. His family seems very strange.</span> <br>
