/* Diaper Kink */
<<else>>
    Despite your own embarrassment at witnessing this, <span style="color:Pink">you can’t help but watch.</span> First you notice the person changing him, a girl about the same age as the both of you. <span style="color:Pink">Then you briefly see it, as she is placing a new diaper on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>, his absolutely tiny penis. It looked like a cute little grape.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> notices your eyes and laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Like what you see? Maybe next time you can do the changing and get a closer look. I’m sure <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span> wouldn’t mind.”</span> The girl turns around and gives you a humorous smile, <span style="color:Pink">both of them seeing this as completely normal.</span> <br>
    <br>
    /* Girl Content */
    <<if $ToggleGirlContent == 1>>
        <span style="color:Pink">It is at that moment that you realize <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span> also has what appears to be a diaper puffing out of her bottoms. You blush upon realizing this, both of these kids your age are wearing such embarrassing undergarments and don’t seem to have a care in the world about it. You turn even redder at the possibility that you may have instead seen this situation reversed had you come at a different time.</span> <br>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <span style="color:Pink">Now in a fresh diaper, though not bothering to pull up his bottoms, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> walks up to you, bottle still in hand.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“This is my sis, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span>, she likes to help me out when I get kinda full.”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:Pink">patting the soft, crinkly front of his diaper.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But if I would have known you were here, I would have asked you. I think you’d be great at changing diapers!”</span> They both giggle, finding the idea funny. <br>
    
