    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Nice to meet you, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span> gives you a smile and a playful wave, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> mentioned how you met at dinner the other night. That must have been super funny, he said the look on your face was hilarious! Wish I could have been there.”</span> They laugh once more as you try to grapple with the idea that he retold your meeting at the dinner table. <br>
    <br>
    /* PC Wearing Diaper */
    <<if $PlayerUndies.Tags.includes("Diaper")>>
        <span style="color:Pink">You are only broken out of your stupor when you feel a hand grip the edge of your $PlayerUndies.Type and tug. You quickly turn bright red and leap back.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Awwww, he’s so shy!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ivy</span> giggles, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I think it’s cute that you wear them too, I would love to see them sometime!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! That’s be super cool! I bet they have some cool designs on them!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> adds happily, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We have some spares if you need a change as well. I would love to give you a changing!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You suddenly feel like a rat trapped in a corner, with both of these kids not only discovering what you are wearing, but offering, or more so, insisting, that they change you right here and now! You suddenly find yourself feeling a lot smaller than usual.</span> <br>
        <br>
    <</if>>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Awww, he’s so red. You’re cute.”</span> She laughs, embarrassingly pinching your cheek, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We’re just messing around with you, no need to be so shy.”</span> You then hear a small beeping and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> quickly checks his watch. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Boo, it’s already time to go?”</span> He pouts, sounding a bit like a toddler, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I wanted to play more. Oh well.”</span> He arms slump down and he sighs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“We gotta go, we have a photoshoot to do and if we’re late daddy will get really mad. But we’ll see you later! Maybe next time we can show you what we do for fun! I’m sure you’ll love it!”</span> He waves as the two of them run off. <span style="color:Pink">You are left utterly bewildered by what you just witnessed. His family seems very strange.</span> <br>
